| Obey file: start Xriscos, the X server in a desktop window, as a Wimp task.
| StartX runs inside the new task, so its WimpSlot sizes that task.
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.07 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.SharedULib
| Arguments (e.g. -rootless) are passed on to the server.
Set Xriscos$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Dir <Obey$Dir>
WimpTask Obey <Obey$Dir>.StartX %*0
